  "app_id": "infor-connector",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "name": "Infor (ION API Gateway)",
  "description": "Connect your own Infor OS tenant via ION API Gateway OAuth2 credentials. Make generic authenticated REST calls to any ION-routed endpoint across your licensed Infor CloudSuite products (LN, M3, SunSystems, and others), and manage ION Workflow tasks and Document Flow messages.",
